  unitName: Ascha, the Devourer
  unitId: 810888
  unitNumber: 8643
  description: "At languid flame the withered tongues of menWhispered frightfully
    a name beyond ken.But fit the cosmic-shadowed dancer sawTo grant their timeworn
    audience twilight's fall.Behold, shattered carapace of mine flesh\u2014Behold!
    That which is dead shall live again!Colors in hues too ill for mortal eyes;Pulsing
    static, ichoric, breathless cries\u2014Echoed thunder, hollow ring: cloudless
    skiesCould not bear the curse of ancient demise\u2014And here, I rise. Smoldering
    with greater vice.I turn, and burn; there will be nothing leftWhen I am sated.
    And all that is, shall restIn ash and dust. Even time will forgetThat once there
    was love. Hate. Perhaps regret.Only hunger remains. For I aloneIn dim memory
    recall the last that shone.The ones before that showed me the way home."
  summonDesc: Some are compelled to consume.<br>Others hunger to be devoured.<br>You'll
    know which one you are, soon enough.
  fusionDesc: ...Is that all?
  evoDesc: This pleases me.<br>But not for long.
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
